- tests/units/reasoning/test_full_reasoning_removals.py (new)
- tests/units/api/test_if_then_retraction_routes.py (new)
- tests/units/reasoning/test_if_then_retraction.py
- changelogs/v0.10.0/benoitcayladbx_2026-11-26.log

### Test result
